OL,3,GNEWSANew court rooms created to tackle
OL,4,A'busy schedule'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new court rooms have opened at a
OL,7,Fgovernment-owned building to help deal
OL,8,Fwith a "busy schedule".
OL,10,FBailiff of Jersey Robert MacRae said
OL,11,Fthe rooms inside Jubilee Wharf on the
OL,12,FEsplanade, St Helier, would help
OL,13,F"accommodate many cases already listed
OL,14,Fand to be listed in the future".
OL,16,FThe Bailiff's Office said one room had
OL,17,Fbeen designed specifically to
OL,18,Faccommodate jury trials, the first
OL,19,Fbeing the hearing into the explosion at
OL,20,Fthe Haut du Mont block of flats in Pier
OL,21,FRoad that killed 10 people, which is
OL,22,Fdue to start on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
